  suite_cli_built.adam - a clean build's phase lines and status line (no
  banner, no --quiet): Parse (units, lines), Analyze, Lower (routines),
  Generate (code bytes), Link (the exe's name, the libraries it imports),
  each with its seconds; then the main module as given, the exe as written,
  the seconds it all took (<NUM>: lines, routines, bytes and seconds differ
  as the runtime grows and run to run), exit 0
*******************************************************************************/

