  | Analyzed in <NUM>s
  | Lowered <NUM> routines in <NUM>s
  | Generated <NUM> bytes of code in <NUM>s
  | Linked suite_cli_built.exe (libraries: 3) in <NUM>s
  | Built <DIR>/suite_cli_built.adam -> <OUT>/bin/suite_cli_built.exe in <NUM>s
@@end
*/

module exe suite_cli_built;

begin
end.
